            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I still don't have minimal reproduction without 'mini.completion', but:\n- The route cause is presence of `fuzzy` flag in 'completeopt'. Removing it makes everything work as expected.\n- The issue was introduced by [this commit](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/commit/bcfc22853af17086f5d75c7a2e59cb648c572613).",
